{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:14 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:14 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:14 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"「賢知有您」落飛得手  蘇偉賢今年首勝谷草\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/f24149c52f2267bbf9f01064bb72b6d4/2026-10/r7_4.jpg\"/><p>雖然蘇偉賢每季皆成績平穩，但原來對上一次在谷草贏馬，已數到去年十二月十七日勝出的「臻至辰」；今晚練者終在窄場發威，第七場憑「賢知友您」配奧爾民贏馬，練者取得其今年首場谷草頭馬之餘，此馬閘前更着綠格至6.5倍開跑，結果飛到馬到。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T14:22:23.093681+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:14:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T14:17:43.274908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:17:43.274908+00:00","content_hash":"48ec1702948952e16e7cef51b644a1a1ae3cdb699f9fbcc841a352fe801aeebc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}